Wait — one possible concern in browser prunePublishedPrefix: awaiting `terminal` (transactionResult) inside the try after issuing all requests. The awaits inside the loop are on requests of the same transaction, keeping it alive. Good per plan ("awaits only requests belonging to that live IndexedDB transaction until it reaches a terminal event").

